To use this Makefile to build the NEMO rebuild exec, two things are required:
    1. make template file, which is used to define the compiler/settings. This is defined with the 
       COMPILER_TEMPLATE=/path/to/make/template/file argument
    2. a compilation environment

Both of these are platform dependent, and in regards to the compilation environment, it is possible you 
don't need one.

To gain access to needed files, you can either rely on the production compilation systems to 
pick them up for you, or you can find them in the following locations:
    1. For a fully coupled run: /path/to/super/repo/CanESM/CONFIG/PLATFORM
    2. For an ocean only run: /path/to/nemo/repo/CanNEMO/nemo/ARCH
